; ==============================================================================
; DNS Zone File for bossofai.org
; Target Platform: Vercel Global Edge Network
; Standard: RFC 1035 BIND Zone File Format (Cloudflare, Route53, Namecheap, etc.)
; ==============================================================================

$ORIGIN bossofai.org.
$TTL 3600

; --- SOA Record (Start of Authority) ---
@   IN  SOA ns1.vercel-dns.com. hostmaster.bossofai.org. (
        2026100501 ; Serial (YYYYMMDDNN)
        7200       ; Refresh (2 hours)
        3600       ; Retry (1 hour)
        1209600    ; Expire (2 weeks)
        3600       ; Minimum TTL (1 hour)
)

; --- Primary Apex Website Record (Vercel Anycast IP) ---
@   IN  A      76.76.21.21

; --- Subdomain Record (www redirects/points to Vercel) ---
www IN  CNAME  cname.vercel-dns.com.

; --- Certificate Authority Authorization (Allows automatic SSL via Let's Encrypt / Google Trust) ---
@   IN  CAA    0 issue "letsencrypt.org"
@   IN  CAA    0 issue "pki.goog"
